  "permlink": "https://cafe.daum.net/sedu22/evuJ/276",
  "contentHtml": "<p>시각, 청각 자극에 대한 반응 속도를 측정하는&#160;</p><p>탐구활동을 위해&#160;</p><p>탐구계획서를 모둠별로 작성하게 하고,</p><p>계획서를 교사가 피드백을 해줍니다.</p><p>&#160;</p><p><a href=\"https://youtu.be/3HlzmVzpugE?si=Ju48UsOD6OAXR5Ty\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"ke-link\">https://youtu.be/3HlzmVzpugE?si=Ju48UsOD6OAXR5Ty</a></p><div class=\"figure-video\" data-ke-type=\"video\" data-video-url=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=3HlzmVzpugE\" data-video-host=\"youtube\" data-video-play-service=\"daum_cafe\" data-video-width=\"480\" data-video-height=\"360\" data-ke-style=\"alignLeft\" data-video-thumbnail=\"https://scrap.kakaocdn.net/dn/YbPG9/hyXWC8QN7k/G21FAWjTedAOtqE5KzafhK/img.jpg?width=480&amp;height=360&amp;face=0_0_480_360,https://scrap.kakaocdn.net/dn/bvry32/hyX0noIrxP/iQTpQyKDFnLmAr8c5ttxik/img.jpg?width=480&amp;height=360&amp;face=0_0_480_360\" data-ke-mobile-mobilestyle=\"widthContent\" data-video-origin-width=\"480\" data-video-origin-height=\"360\"><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/3HlzmVzpugE\" width=\"480\" height=\"360\" frameborder=\"0\" scrolling=\"no\" allowfullscreen=\"\"></iframe><div class=\"figcaption\"></div></div><p>&#160;</p><p>그런데 여러 모둠의 계획서를 하나씩 피드백해주는</p><p>시간과 노력의 효율을 높이기 위해&#160;</p><p>AI를 활용하였습니다.</p><p>&#160;</p><p>1. 자극과 반응 탐구활동에 대해 AI를 학습시킵니다.</p><p>&#160;</p><p>2. 계획서를 사진 찍어서 올립니다.</p><p>&#160; <i><b>&#160; (청각에 따른 반응 속도를 탐구한다고 할 때</b></i></p><p><i><b>&#160; &#160; &#160;아래의 탐구계획서에서 어떤 내용을 수정해야 할까요?)</b></i></p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignLeft\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/f1b36dccd90ec908824046ba6dcefcae987f1e43\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/f1b36dccd90ec908824046ba6dcefcae987f1e43\" data-origin-width=\"525\" data-origin-height=\"298\"></div><p>&#160;</p><p>3.&#160; 아래는 AI가 피드백해준 결과입니다.</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignLeft\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/12b4feb3b538347396b46a5b1eb05f75cc6e13ca\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"700\" height=\"369\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/12b4feb3b538347396b46a5b1eb05f75cc6e13ca\" data-origin-width=\"935\" data-origin-height=\"493\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/2788449bdfd0b87e09b370a36154e2e4c7c66ed8\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/2788449bdfd0b87e09b370a36154e2e4c7c66ed8\" data-origin-width=\"914\" data-origin-height=\"226\"></div><p>&#160;</p><p>4. 피드백해준 내용을 학생들에게 공유하고, 실험 계획을 수정하게 합니다.</p><p>&#160;</p><p>&#160;</p><p>5. 해당 실험을 반복하면 <b>&#39;훈련효과&#39;</b>가 나타날 수 있습니다.</p><p>&#160; &#160;AI에게 훈련효과를 줄일 수 있는 방법을 알려달라고 했습니다.</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignLeft\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/d5e516d7f96dc44203839b5da2a304873f228bdb\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"650\" height=\"181\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/d5e516d7f96dc44203839b5da2a304873f228bdb\" data-origin-width=\"977\" data-origin-height=\"272\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignLeft\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/0309b09f6b1746d3a3c55a3a0ff87c635b6fd762\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"650\" height=\"424\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/0309b09f6b1746d3a3c55a3a0ff87c635b6fd762\" data-origin-width=\"919\" data-origin-height=\"600\"></div><p>&#160;</p><p>6. 거리-시간 그래프를 이용하지 않고, 반응 시간을 알아내는 방법도 알려줍니다.</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignLeft\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/2280e74423cc0b9246889a80a66c049521eeb4b6\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"447\" height=\"302\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/2280e74423cc0b9246889a80a66c049521eeb4b6\" data-origin-width=\"634\" data-origin-height=\"428\"></div><p>&#160;</p><p>챗GPT가 실험계획을 세우거나 피드백해주는데&#160;</p><p>매우 효율적입니다!</p><p>&#160;</p><p>챗GPT 전체 영상입니다.</p><p><a href=\"https://youtu.be/k6Fjs8P4cjw\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"ke-link\">https://youtu.be/k6Fjs8P4cjw</a></p><div class=\"figure-video\" data-ke-type=\"video\" data-video-url=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=k6Fjs8P4cjw\" data-video-host=\"youtube\" data-video-play-service=\"daum_cafe\" data-video-width=\"480\" data-video-height=\"360\" data-ke-style=\"alignLeft\" data-video-thumbnail=\"https://scrap.kakaocdn.net/dn/cUUzy4/hyX0sqgdkE/GPynvbn58OEDgYK27MV8c1/img.jpg?width=480&amp;height=360&amp;face=0_0_480_360,https://scrap.kakaocdn.net/dn/uAQuN/hyX0ziCOzT/6AXnw9c0FKIi2zn9ySUqnK/img.jpg?width=480&amp;height=360&amp;face=0_0_480_360\" data-ke-mobile-mobilestyle=\"widthContent\" data-video-origin-width=\"480\" data-video-origin-height=\"360\"><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/k6Fjs8P4cjw\" width=\"480\" height=\"360\" frameborder=\"0\" scrolling=\"no\" allowfullscreen=\"\"></iframe><div class=\"figcaption\"></div></div><p>&#160;</p><p>&#160;</p>\n\t \t\t\t\t\t<!-- -->",
